  "priorExpiration": "2007-05-17",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3308.02 Renewal of Manufacturer. On an annual basis, no later than 45 days prior to the expiration of manufacturer approval pursuant to Saf-C 3308.01(d), the manufacturer shall submit the following to the department:\n\n(a) A completed application, pursuant to Saf-C 3308.01, clearly reflecting any changes, amendments, or revisions to its building system or quality assurance program; and\n\n(b) A renewal fee of $1000.00 to the department, pursuant to RSA 205-C:6.\n\nSource. #5439, eff 7-24-92; ss by #6810, INTERIM, eff 7-25-98, EXPIRES: 11-22-98; ss by #6885, eff 11-18-98;ss by #8741, INTERIM, eff 11-18-06, EXPIRED: 5-17-07\n\nNew. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c3300.html"
